<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Leventis Q3 profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Leventis Q3 profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Nigerian conglomerate A.G. Leventis to end-September 1996.(In million naira)</p>
<p>				   1996	     1995</p>
<p> Turnover		     1,500     vs   1,300</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   149.3     vs   140.3</p>
<p> Taxation			47.8     vs    44.9</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    101.5     vs    95.4</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
